# ── Layout tiers ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# estate/ is the control plane. Everything with its own history or its own
# vendored upstream lives in a sibling tier and is NOT indexed here.
# Commit project work inside ranch/, control-plane work in this repo.

# project monorepo — registered submodule (path=ranch, url=./ranch, 95a114a5a).
# NOT ignored: gitignore entries cannot touch a tracked submodule; the stale
# ranch/ ignore entry was removed so the manifest reflects the submodule layout.

# third-party checkouts (Hyprland, WhiteSur, ansible, ...) — own remotes
vendored/
# external projects with their own git remotes
projects/*
!projects/OmniRoute

# runtime state: archives, reconciliation snapshots, legacy, scratch
var/
# hatch/ — control-cell tree lives at github.com/toxicwind/hatch (PRIVATE),
# live checkout /home/toxic/hatch on yote. The 2026-10-02 removal never
# fully landed (258 tracked files lingered as a stale copy; the live repo
# is 1248 diffs ahead). Completed 2026-10-15; backup branch
# backup/hatch-tree-20261015 preserves the in-tree copy.
/hatch/

# scratch/ — 2108 tracked scratch files including PII fixtures (an old
# credit-report email). Scratch is never tracked.
/scratch/

# ── Root-level compat symlinks ───────────────────────────────────────────
# These resolve into ranch/ (or $HOME). Nothing to track — they are
# navigation, not source. Kept for backwards compatibility with configs
# that still spell the old paths.

/herd
/qed
/yote
/mesh
/openfang
/shell
/models
/shingle-workspace

# ── Runtime state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Recreated on demand by daemons and audits. Never committed.

/data/
/log/
/runs/
/output/
/coverage/
/tmp/

